\cf0 The key to successful multi-device GUI design is understanding that you're not just scaling layouts - you're adapting entire interaction models to match how people actually use different devices. Each screen size represents a different context, different capabilities, and different user expectations.\
Test early, test often, and always prioritize the user's actual workflow over visual consistency. A GUI that works beautifully is infinitely better than one that looks identical everywhere but frustrates users on every platform.\
